  "body": "Follow-up from #50. TNC 640 User's Manual, ISO programming (ID 892909-25) p. 143: ISO programs carry the .I extension. The post's file extension is still nc; the host ignores it, so it only bites at transfer to the control.\n\nDone means: the Heidenhain post's output extension is .I, pinned by a test.",
